---
---
<html lang="zh-CN">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>Kotoba - 沉浸式日语学习</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Sans+SC:wght@300;500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="bg-orb orb-1"></div>
    <div class="bg-orb orb-2"></div>

    <nav class="navbar">
      <div class="logo">Kotoba.</div>
      <div class="nav-links">
        <a href="#">功能</a>
        <a href="#">题库</a>
        <a href="#">关于</a>
      </div>
      <button class="btn-login">登录</button>
    </nav>

    <main class="hero">
      <div class="hero-content">
        <div class="badge">✨ 全新 V2.0 版本已上线</div>
        <h1>打破选择题的枷锁<br><span class="gradient-text">真正学会开口说日语</span></h1>
        <p>放弃机械的选项记忆。通过智能拼图、主动回忆与真实场景，将多邻国学到的知识转化为你的直觉。</p>
        <div class="cta-group">
          <button class="btn-primary">开始免费体验</button>
          <button class="btn-secondary">查看介绍 →</button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="hero-visual">
        <div class="glass-card main-card">
          <div class="card-header">
            <span class="dot red"></span>
            <span class="dot yellow"></span>
            <span class="dot green"></span>
          </div>
          <div class="card-body">
            <p class="prompt">请给我一杯水（礼貌）</p>
            <div class="blocks">
              <span class="block">水</span>
              <span class="block">を</span>
              <span class="block">ください</span>
            </div>
            <div class="feedback success">✅ 完美！</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="glass-card sub-card">
          <p>🔥 连续打卡 12 天</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </main>

    <section class="features">
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="icon">🧠</div>
        <h3>主动回忆训练</h3>
        <p>不再让你做多选题，逼迫大脑从零生成句子，记忆效率提升 300%。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="icon">🧩</div>
        <h3>渐进式拼图</h3>
        <p>从词块拼图到全键盘输入，平滑过渡，彻底告别“提笔忘字”。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="icon">🎙️</div>
        <h3>精准发音评估</h3>
        <p>本地神经语音合成，配合你的发音练习，告别哑巴外语。</p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  :root {
    --bg-color: #0a0a0f;
    --text-main: #f0f0f5;
    --text-muted: #9a9aaf;
    --primary: #58cc02;
    --primary-glow: rgba(88, 204, 2, 0.3);
    --glass-bg: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
    --glass-border: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
  }
  
  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  
  body {
    background-color: var(--bg-color);
    color: var(--text-main);
    font-family: 'Noto Sans SC', sans-serif;
    min-height: 100vh;
    overflow-x: hidden;
    position: relative;
  }

  /* 动态背景光晕 */
  .bg-orb {
    position: absolute;
    border-radius: 50%;
    filter: blur(100px);
    z-index: -1;
  }
  .orb-1 {
    width: 500px; height: 500px;
    background: rgba(88, 204, 2, 0.15);
    top: -100px; right: -100px;
  }
  .orb-2 {
    width: 400px; height: 400px;
    background: rgba(26, 115, 232, 0.15);
    bottom: 0; left: -100px;
  }

  /* 导航栏 */
  .navbar {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 1.5rem 5%;
    background: rgba(10, 10, 15, 0.7);
    backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    position: fixed;
    width: 100%;
    top: 0;
    z-index: 100;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
  }
  .logo { font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1px; }
  .nav-links a {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    text-decoration: none;
    margin: 0 1.5rem;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    transition: color 0.3s;
  }
  .nav-links a:hover { color: var(--text-main); }
  .btn-login {
    background: transparent;
    border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
    color: var(--text-main);
    padding: 0.5rem 1.2rem;
    border-radius: 20px;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.3s;
  }
  .btn-login:hover { background: var(--glass-bg); }

  /* 主视觉区 */
  .hero {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 10rem 10% 5rem;
    min-height: 100vh;
    gap: 4rem;
  }
  .hero-content { flex: 1; max-width: 600px; }
  .badge {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0.4rem 1rem;
    background: var(--glass-bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
    border-radius: 20px;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: #a0e070;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  h1 {
    font-size: 3.5rem;
    line-height: 1.2;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  .gradient-text {
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, #58cc02, #1a73e8);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
  }
  p {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .cta-group { display: flex; gap: 1rem; }
  .btn-primary {
    background: var(--primary);
    color: #000;
    border: none;
    padding: 1rem 2rem;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    border-radius: 30px;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
    box-shadow: 0 0 20px var(--primary-glow);
  }
  .btn-primary:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 0 30px var(--primary-glow);
  }
  .btn-secondary {
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--text-main);
    border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
    padding: 1rem 2rem;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    border-radius: 30px;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: background 0.3s;
  }
  .btn-secondary:hover { background: var(--glass-bg); }

  /* 视觉展示区（毛玻璃卡片） */
  .hero-visual {
    flex: 1;
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  .glass-card {
    background: var(--glass-bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
    backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
    border-radius: 20px;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
  }
  .main-card { width: 100%; max-width: 400px; z-index: 2; }
  .card-header { display: flex; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .dot { width: 12px; height: 12px; border-radius: 50%; }
  .red { background: #ff5f56; }
  .yellow { background: #ffbd2e; }
  .green { background: #27c93f; }
  
  .prompt { color: var(--text-main); font-weight: 500; font-size: 1.1rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .blocks { display: flex; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
  .block {
    background: #2a2a35;
    padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    border: 1px solid #444;
  }
  .feedback {
    padding: 0.8rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .success { background: rgba(88, 204, 2, 0.1); color: #58cc02; border: 1px solid rgba(88, 204, 2, 0.2); }
  
  .sub-card {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: -30px;
    right: -20px;
    padding: 1rem 1.5rem;
    z-index: 3;
  }
  .sub-card p { margin: 0; font-size: 0.9rem; color: #ffd700; }

  /* 功能卡片区 */
  .features {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
    gap: 2rem;
    padding: 2rem 10% 8rem;
  }
  .feature-card {
    background: var(--glass-bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
    padding: 2rem;
    border-radius: 16px;
    transition: transform 0.3s, background 0.3s;
  }
  .feature-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-5px);
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
  }
  .feature-card .icon { font-size: 2rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .feature-card h3 { font-size: 1.2rem; margin-bottom: 0.8rem; font-weight: 500; }
  .feature-card p { font-size: 0.95rem; margin-bottom: 0; }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .hero { flex-direction: column; text-align: center; padding-top: 8rem; }
    h1 { font-size: 2.5rem; }
    .cta-group { justify-content: center; }
    .nav-links { display: none; }
  }
</style>
